==Battleground==
*1 [[Sonic (Enemy)|Sonic]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields, [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and backliners like [[Dragon Cat]] to win easily.

